      "text": "One must look within the heart.",
      "path": "audio/1971-351/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.50619,
      "end": 7.366281
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "So do not believe the eyes, believe the heart and remember to look through it, and then you will come to know things unbelievable.",
